From b33332bd3a1f44616bd5bc6b1534af301c705e63 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: paawandesai <paawankdesai@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 11:17:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(observability): tag FHIR tool-call events with the turn's
 use case and key

feat/w2-observability wrapped every FHIR read in tool_call() without the
caller's use_case or patient_session_key, so each read in a turn emitted
an untagged tool_call_event. Week 1 evals I2 and I11 check that every
event of a turn is attributable and failed on main for that reason. The
search helpers and the Patient read now pass the caller's tags through;
every graph that reads the chart supplies them.
